OL,3,GNEWSA'Lottery win means I can pursue my
OL,4,Adream'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbbie West-Long was preparing to change
OL,7,Fher dream to move to Canada with her
OL,8,Fpartner, when she had a knock at the
OL,9,Fdoor.
OL,11,FAfter learning she'd won #333,332 in
OL,12,Fthe Postcode Lottery, the charity
OL,13,Fvolunteer said she "just started
OL,14,Fcrying".
OL,16,FNow, the 34-year-old from Cowes on the
OL,17,FIsle of Wight says she can chase her
OL,18,Fdream and build a new life with partner
OL,19,FDaryl Marlow in the Canadian Rockies.
